{"id":"73cb2f85d7abd7df","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-truth-value-glut.md","title":"双向语义与编码真理外延中的过剩","display":"df-truth-value-glut — 双向语义与编码真理外延中的过剩","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-truth-value-glut","aliases":["91-df-truth-value-glut","91-df-glut"],"display":"df-truth-value-glut — 双向语义与编码真理外延中的过剩","depends_on":["[[91-df-coded-syntax]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-truth-value-glut"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-truth-value-glut</span><span>91-df-glut</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-truth-value-glut — 双向语义与编码真理外延中的过剩"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"38c875c58a0bf84c\" href=\"?note=38c875c58a0bf84c\" title=\"91-df-coded-syntax\">91-df-coded-syntax</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> 搭配肯定/否定支持关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models^+,\\models^-\">\\(\\models^+,\\models^-\\)</span>；它们不假设是外层经典满足及其补集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq C_T\">\\(X\\subseteq C_T\\)</span> 是可不一致的编码真信息，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Glut}_{\\mathcal B}\">\\(\\mathrm{Glut}_{\\mathcal B}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Glut}_X\">\\(\\mathrm{Glut}_X\\)</span> 为下述集合及谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}value\\text{-}glut}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Glut}_{\\mathcal B}\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi:\\mathcal B\\models^+\\varphi\\land\\mathcal B\\models^-\\varphi\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}value\\text{-}glut}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Glut}_{\\mathcal B}\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi:\\mathcal B\\models^+\\varphi\\land\\mathcal B\\models^-\\varphi\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Glut}_X(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X\\land\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Glut}_X(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X\\land\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>广义强 Kleene 语义容许扩张与反扩张重叠，此时需四种支持状态；真正的一致三值解释排除重叠。\n在经典闭包 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathbb N,T\\mapsto X)\">\\((\\mathbb N,T\\mapsto X)\\)</span> 中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\land T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner})\">\\(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\land T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner})\\)</span> 可真而外层仍是完全一致的经典结构。因为 KF 没有全语言 T-out，它不会自动推出外层 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\land\\neg\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\land\\neg\\varphi\\)</span>。因此“经典 KF 一定排除内部过剩”或“出现过剩必然使 KF 爆炸”都错误；CONS 才排除此内部状态。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 15.10、Theorem 15.15、Lemmas 15.16–15.17，印刷页 192–199。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-coded-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"38c875c58a0bf84c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-coded-syntax]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\models^+,\\models^-","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq C_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Glut}_{\\mathcal B}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Glut}_X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}value\\text{-}glut}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Glut}_{\\mathcal B}\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi:\\mathcal B\\models^+\\varphi\\land\\mathcal B\\models^-\\varphi\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Glut}_X(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X\\land\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X.","display":true},{"tex":"(\\mathbb N,T\\mapsto X)","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\land T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\land\\neg\\varphi","display":false}],"bytes":1590,"backlinks":[{"id":"0471e9434da6820e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-27","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-value-glut]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-49","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-value-glut]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-113","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-coded-syntax.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-expressive-completeness.md]]\n[[91-df-external-c